# Keep the build context small & the image clean (P0d).
.git
# Secrets: never bake an env file into an image. `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is the
# committed template and is not needed in any image (Dockerfiles COPY only src/configs/ui).
.env
.env.*
data/
logs/
notebooks/
scripts/
tests/
docs/design/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.deepeval/
.claude/
*.md
# Node build artifacts (the UI image rebuilds from source in a multi-stage node stage).
**/node_modules/
ui/app/dist/
**/.vite/
**/*.tmp
